sions if any other issues are found around UI layout and resolutions along with any bugs found of course.Thanks,Birchwood Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T19:03:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942056","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1651430-1845383656390825","game_id":"steam-1651430","kind":"announcement","title":"Gladiator Immortal - End of Play Test (Oct 4th)","summary":"Thanks for everyone who has tried the Play Test and added/reported thoughts / comments and bugs. All appreciated !The Play Test will end today (October 4th).It has been running for approx. 1 month, initially to internal testers, then a larger set of external testers and then open to all for the last 8-9 days. This has allowed us to both update the Play Test and a separate demo build intended to go live shortly. These changes were incorporated into the upcoming demo (which includes a few more sur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T09:08:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390825","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1651430-1844751498222047","game_id":"steam-1651430","kind":"announcement","title":"Gladiator Immortal Play Test Now Available","summary":"The Play Test will include:-Town Development to Level 3Gladiator Levels 1-5Tournament Tier Level 1 (with approx. 25 battles per tier)13 MasteriesAround 6 Skills per MasteryDevotion Skills levels 1 and 2Assignments, levels 1-55 Arenas (with random modifiers)12 BossesCommon/Uncommon/Rare Equipment and Weapons+ more","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T16:17:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-1651430-1844115010492834","game_id":"steam-1651430","kind":"announcement","title":"Gladiator Immortal Play Test","summary":"The Public Play Test for Gladiator Immortal will be available from the 24th September for approximately 1 week.The Play Test will include:-Town Development to Level 3Gladiator Levels 1-5Tournament Tier Level 1 (with approx. 25 battles per tier)13 MasteriesAround 6 Skills per MasteryDevotion Skills levels 1 and 2Assignments, levels 1-55 Arenas (with random modifiers)12 BossesCommon/Uncommon/Rare Equipment and Weapons+ moreWe hope you will find some time to look at the game, report any issues, add","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T17:33:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492834","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:01:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-1651430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-1651430":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"1651430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z"},"5348760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:51:45Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-1651430","app_id":1651430,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:06Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","lang